{"id":"n14316-1-6","stage":2,"title":"약혼자 · 订婚对象","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14316-1-6-1","ko":"네 약혼자는 어떤 사람이야?","zh":"你的未婚夫是怎样的一个人呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"약혼자는","meaning":"订婚对象，未婚夫，未婚妻","explanation":"약혼자：订婚对象，未婚夫，未婚妻；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"약혼자","audio":"/audio/115d7ce041b9a3ecf781.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14316","senseId":"1","lemma":"약혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이야?","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"115d7ce041b9a3ec","term":"약혼자","zh":"订婚对象，未婚夫，未婚妻","audio":"/audio/115d7ce041b9a3ecf781.mp3","entryId":"14316","definition":"约定结婚的人。","pronunciation":["야콘자"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]}],"audio":"/audio/44cdc6f407a73df060ec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14316-1-6-2","ko":"그냥 착하고 좋은 사람이야.","zh":"就是